WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.331 --> 00:00:03.280
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.752
- Everybody loves ice cream.

00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:06.960
Even those who say they
don't like ice cream,

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.491
still love ice cream.

00:00:09.491 --> 00:00:13.658
We use ice cream as a way
to support our community.

00:00:21.251 --> 00:00:23.152
My name is Michael “Mikey” Cole,

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:26.069
and I own Mikey Likes It Ice Cream.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.171
I did not always sell ice cream.

00:00:29.171 --> 00:00:31.781
I was born in the Lower East
Side of New York City,

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:34.352
the East Village, two
blocks from the shop.

00:00:34.352 --> 00:00:36.210
Bustlin' drugs at one point.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.650
I ended up getting caught,

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.010
ended up going to jail for six months.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.469
A few years ago, my mother got sick;

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:44.509
I promised to her that I wouldn't

00:00:44.509 --> 00:00:48.305
be locked up anymore, do the wrong things.

00:00:48.305 --> 00:00:51.097
Ice cream was something
that just came into my life

00:00:51.097 --> 00:00:52.898
at a time when I didn't really

00:00:52.898 --> 00:00:55.398
know what I was kind of doing.

00:00:56.959 --> 00:01:00.879
This is pop culture inspired ice cream.

00:01:00.879 --> 00:01:02.957
We have Jack and Jill, Truffle Shuffle,

00:01:02.957 --> 00:01:06.223
Ice Ice Baby, Pink Floyd, Mint Condition,

00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:10.306
Southern Hospitality and
we have Smooth Operator.

00:01:11.269 --> 00:01:13.909
A bunch of famous people
have come by here.

00:01:13.909 --> 00:01:16.799
Future's a fan, Joakim Noah's a fan,

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:19.538
Hillary Clinton's a fan.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:22.098
We have a lot of other
fans up there as well.

00:01:22.098 --> 00:01:25.146
I'm good, I'm good, alright fellas.

00:01:25.146 --> 00:01:27.319
I still live two blocks from the store.

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:31.650
Part of our job is to still
be heavily in the community

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.938
and so if kids come in here
with an A on their report card,

00:01:34.938 --> 00:01:37.349
we give them a free scoop of ice cream,

00:01:37.349 --> 00:01:40.728
just to show them that
we are the same as them.

00:01:40.728 --> 00:01:42.578
So I'm just a little older,

00:01:42.578 --> 00:01:44.878
but I'm still the same child at heart,

00:01:44.878 --> 00:01:46.850
and if you can find
something that you like

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:50.227
and you're passionate about,
go forth and just go for it.

00:01:50.227 --> 00:01:52.803
You know, don't not go for your dreams,

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:55.803
go for every last one that you have.

